    {
      "id": "hastamalaka-stotram-1",
      "label": "Verse 1",
      "number": "1",
      "deva": "निमित्तं मनश्चक्षुरादिप्रवृत्तौ\nनिरस्ताखिलोपाधिराकाशकल्पः ।\nरविर्लोकचेष्टानिमित्तं यथा यः\nस नित्योपलब्धिस्वरूपोऽहमात्मा ॥१॥",
      "translation": "Just as the sun is the cause of the world’s activity, I am the Self, whose nature is ever-present awareness and who is the cause of the mind, eye, and other faculties’ functioning. Free of every limiting adjunct, I am like space.",
