    {
      "id": "hastamalaka-stotram-5",
      "label": "Verse 5",
      "number": "5",
      "deva": "मनश्चक्षुरादेर्वियुक्तः स्वयं यो\nमनश्चक्षुरादेर्मनश्चक्षुरादिः ।\nमनश्चक्षुरादेरगम्यस्वरूपः\nस नित्योपलब्धिस्वरूपोऽहमात्मा ॥५॥",
      "translation": "Though separate from mind, eye, and the rest, I am myself the mind of the mind, the eye of the eye, and so on; my nature cannot be reached by those faculties. I am the Self, whose nature is ever-present awareness.",
