    {
      "id": "hastamalaka-stotram-6",
      "label": "Verse 6",
      "number": "6",
      "deva": "य एको विभाति स्वतः शुद्धचेताः\nप्रकाशस्वरूपोऽपि नानेव धीषु ।\nशरावोदकस्थो यथा भानुरेकः\nस नित्योपलब्धिस्वरूपोऽहमात्मा ॥६॥",
      "translation": "One alone shines by itself, pure awareness; though its nature is light, it seems manifold in different intellects, like one sun appearing [as many] in water held in vessels. I am that Self, whose nature is ever-present awareness.",
