    },
    {
      "id": "hastamalaka-stotram-7",
      "label": "Verse 7",
      "number": "7",
      "deva": "यथानेकचक्षुःप्रकाशो रविर्न\nक्रमेण प्रकाशीकरोति प्रकाश्यम् ।\nअनेका धियो यस्तथैकप्रबोधः\nस नित्योपलब्धिस्वरूपोऽहमात्मा ॥७॥",
      "translation": "As the sun, which lights what is seen by many eyes, does not make it visible one eye after another, so I am the single awareness of many intellects. I am the Self, whose nature is ever-present awareness.",
