    {
      "id": "hastamalaka-stotram-8",
      "label": "Verse 8",
      "number": "8",
      "deva": "विवस्वत्प्रभातं यथारूपमक्षं\nप्रगृह्णाति नाभातमेवं विवस्वान् ।\nयदाभात आभासयत्यक्षमेकः\nस नित्योपलब्धिस्वरूपोऽहमात्मा ॥८॥",
      "translation": "As the eye apprehends a form made visible by the sun, not one left unlit, so the one Self illumines the eye; even the sun is illumined by that Self. I am that Self, whose nature is ever-present awareness.",
